<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50-1.00 up - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50-1.00 up - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 to mostly 1.00 higher.  Demand good onmoderate to smaller movement. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			     Country			    Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs.  56.50-57.50, few 58.00	 57.50-58.50,</p>
<p>								    few 59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 lbs.  51.00-56.00</p>
<p>	   210-230 lbs.  46.50-51.00</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 1.00 lower. Top 50.00. US 1-3   300-450 lbs.  42.00-43.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs.  43.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs.  44.00-49.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 49.50-50.00</p>
